      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NIGHT LIGHTER (1) sizzled around 297m in 17.05 when winning a Free For All at Northam last start. In form and can measure up again. ZATARA'S IMAGE (2) goes very well this trip starting 31 times for 11 wins and 13 minors. Was out of placings last time (22.82) at this track in a OPEN, finishing fifth and beaten 4.5 lengths. Can feature with the right run. SPEEDY DEVILLE (3) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, rewarded with a win last time at this track over 300m. One of the key runners again. MAD HOWLER (6) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a second (17.00) at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start.",
